<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Ipmuda 1996 net up 45.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Ipmuda 1996 net up 45.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   9.70   vs	   6.66</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 13.9    vs	   9.5</p>
<p>    Turnover		   590.35   vs	 514.54</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    17.89   vs	  13.15</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  1.76   vs   less  0.84</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries    less  1.11   vs	   0.31</p>
<p>    Total Div (pct)	   30.0    vs	  10.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Ipmuda Bhd makes and trades building materials.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
